,"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/milestones/51","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/milestone/51","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/milestones/51/labels","id":3850624,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMzg1MDYyNA==","number":51,"title":"1.4","description":null,"creator":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":263,"state":"closed","created_at":"2018-11-27T04:11:27Z","updated_at":"2023-03-07T15:41:37Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2021-03-18T12:29:03Z"},"comments":8,"created_at":"2020-12-18T15:58:09Z","updated_at":"2020-12-19T15:43:44Z","closed_at":"2020-12-19T15:43:44Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nWhen using `Values`, with a specific `Column`, I would expect the `data` entries to be converted into something acceptable for the provided `Column`, just like we assign a value to a given `Column`. Instead we are getting `NULL`.\r\nThis happens with regular / sqlalchemy `Enum` and also with Numpy strings (`str_` types)\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nRun the code below:\r\n\r\n```py\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import String, values, column\r\nimport numpy\r\nimport enum\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import Enum as SQLEnum\r\n\r\n# Numpy String Issue\r\nids = numpy.array(['ab', 'cd'], dtype=str)\r\nprint(\"Numpy - Issue\")\r\nprint(values(column(\"value\", String), name=\"ids\", literal_binds=True).data([(_id,) for _id in ids]))\r\n\r\n# Fixed\r\nprint(\"\\nNumpy - Fixed\")\r\nprint(values(column(\"value\", String), name=\"ids\", literal_binds=True).data([(str(_id),) for _id in ids]))\r\nprint(values(column(\"value\", String), name=\"ids\", literal_binds=True).data([(_id,) for _id in ids.astype(object)]))\r\n\r\n# Enum Issue\r\nMyEnum = enum.Enum(\r\n    \"Test\",\r\n    {\r\n      \"A\": \"AA\",\r\n      \"B\": \"BB\"\r\n    }\r\n)\r\n\r\nenums = [MyEnum.A, MyEnum.B]\r\nprint(\"\\n\\nEnum - Issue\")\r\nprint(values(column(\"value\", SQLEnum(MyEnum)), name=\"enums\", literal_binds=True).data([(_enum,) for _enum in enums]))\r\n\r\n# Fixed\r\nprint(\"\\nEnum - Fixed\")\r\nprint(values(column(\"value\", SQLEnum(MyEnum)), name=\"enums\", literal_binds=True).data([(_enum.name,) for _enum in enums]))\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Output:**\r\n```py\r\nNumpy - Issue\r\nVALUES (NULL), (NULL)\r\n\r\nNumpy - Fixed\r\nVALUES ('ab'), ('cd')\r\nVALUES ('ab'), ('cd')\r\n\r\n\r\nEnum - Issue\r\nVALUES (NULL), (NULL)\r\n\r\nEnum - Fixed\r\nVALUES ('A'), ('B')\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Versions.**\r\n - OS: OSX\r\n - Python: 3.8\r\n - SQLAlchemy: 1.4.01b\r\n - Database: PostgreSQL\r\n - DBAPI: psycopg2 \r\n\r\nThanks!\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/5785/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/5785/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}